hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1206","Abu Musa told us, on the authority of Abdul Rahman, on the authority of Sufyan, on the authority of Al-A’mash, on the authority of Abu Sufyan, on the authority of Jabir, on the authority of Abu Sa’id Al-Khudri: on the authority of The Prophet, may God bless him and grant him peace, said: “If one of you performs his prayer in the mosque, let him make his house a share of his prayers, for God will provide “His house is better than his prayers.” This news was narrated by Abu Khaled Al-Ahmar, Abu Muawiyah, Abdah bin Suleiman, and others, on the authority of Al-Amash, on the authority of Abu Sufyan, on the authority of Jabir, They did not mention Abu Sa’id. Abu Kurayb told us, Abu Khalid, on the authority of Al-A’mash, H, and Ahmad bin Mani’ told us, Abu Muawiyah, H. Ziyad bin Ayyub, Abu Muawiyah, and Abdah bin Sulaiman narrated to us, saying: Al-A’mash narrated to us."
